{"data":{"body":"**P2:** `DurableSampler` applies sampling-intent attributes after these span attributes, so a configured sampler can overwrite the execution ARN or set `durable.execution.synthetic_root` to false. That breaks the anchor's stable identity and can cause processors/exporters to misclassify it. Filter these reserved keys from the root's sampling intent, or otherwise ensure explicit SDK attributes win, and add a collision test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM76fxMq","finding_digest":"78225d9af0a7aa39e50da7f3a9df1760708ff1076c115390829e41f4fae914ee","finding_id":"arf_v1_parf3gxqu6vdtzinu7z2txyxmb","finding_key":"otel/execution_root.py::executionroot.export::reserved-attribute-precedence","identity_key":"otel/execution_root.py::executionroot.export::reserved-attribute-precedence","line":59,"observation_digest":"c3bb1cf2b44efd99adb6f65180bb5c550b9c4b16561e0c9b41721ea6d3b27314","observation_id":"aro_v1_yo5rz4vuj36ztlnw6ziybo24ku","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-otel/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_otel/execution_root.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-07T03:00:27Z","review_id":"arr_v1_f3vhmaeq7l3kgg7rlk236t5ody","reviewed_base_sha":"d3b2ddfc73a350593644e628aa91a7ad7aa525e2","reviewed_head_sha":"1a57d1d5ce4db37c955346572b8700b9c0cbe224","reviewer":"codex","start_line":56,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":754},"record_id":"art_v1_2xp5ovnge2ofqo3t6oilof2td3","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T03:00:27Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
